*    a closed door), so neither floor runs into the other. Floor points are
*    heights above each room's bottom.
*    The tube: 211 (from the dock bay), 41, 205, 252 (new), 207, 158 (the old
*    ledge, now the tube's end inside the rock), then the gene lab (159),
*    which starts 90 px further west (x 6023; was 6113).
