setv door 0 254 47 100
*
* 5. The gene lab's teleporter (3 8 2) 121 px west, past the rock face where
*    creatures come out of the tube (owner, 2026-11-19). Its scripts place
*    arrivals relative to itself.
enum 3 8 2 doif posl gt 6100 and posl lt 6200 and post gt 1650 mvby -121 0 endi next
*
* 6. The pictures. ztwb, ztwf, ztwr and ztwg are cut from the player's own
*    game (art/tube_walk.py; made in the engine, madeart/tube_walk*.cpp);
*    ztdp, the props under the old deck, is our own (art/lift_deck_props.py).
*    The game's own pieces they replace go: the old tube's front (swmp at
*    4735,1410), the old deck's boxes at its two ends (4933,1556 and
*    5212,1555), the gene lab's old west wall (genc at 5923,1470) and its
*    top beam (genc at 5995,1478; ztwg is the same without its west end).
*    (one ENUM each: after KILL the loop's TARG is gone)
enum 1 0 0 doif posl eq 4735 and post eq 1410 kill targ endi next
enum 1 0 0 doif posl eq 4933 and post eq 1556 kill targ endi next
enum 1 0 0 doif posl eq 5212 and post eq 1555 kill targ endi next
enum 1 0 0 doif posl eq 5923 and post eq 1470 kill targ endi next
enum 1 0 0 doif posl eq 5995 and post eq 1478 kill targ endi next
enum 2 3 257 kill targ next
enum 2 3 258 kill targ next
enum 2 3 259 kill targ next
enum 2 3 260 kill targ next
enum 2 3 261 kill targ next
*    Behind creatures (plane 1500): the reworked scene, over the background,
*    and the props, behind the walkway's railings (plane 9000).
inst new: simp ztwb 1 0 -50 0 setv cls2 2 3 257 setv attr 0 mvto 4718 1300 slow
inst new: simp ztdp 1 0 -30 0 setv cls2 2 3 258 setv attr 0 mvto 4995 1610 slow
*    In front of creatures: the tube's glass (a creature in it seen through
*    it), its rings and the dock's collar, and what stands in front of the
*    tube; the rock face over its east end; the gene lab's top beam. Below
*    the lamps and callers (5000) and the scenery in front (9000).
inst new: simp ztwf 1 0 1800 0 setv cls2 2 3 259 setv attr 0 mvto 4720 1409 slow
inst new: simp ztwr 1 0 1850 0 setv cls2 2 3 260 setv attr 0 mvto 5865 1404 slow
inst new: simp ztwg 1 0 9000 0 setv cls2 2 3 261 setv attr 0 mvto 5995 1478 slow
